 stays at least TF_INKLING_DRAFT_FLOOR (default 0.6), up to 5 deep

The drafter reports each pick's probability (tf_ik_top1p: one 1024-thread block, float4 loads, online
logsumexp; 87 -> 17 us) and stops drafting once the chain falls under the floor. A first draft under it
is not computed in verify. Decode on prose 36-38 -> 39-42 tok/s, code 55 -> 69, 8k context 35 -> 37.
