Subject: [PATCH 19/37] inkling2: prompt passes take tf_ik_prompt_dot (the
 common EXL3 prompt path at any trellis width, 64 members a block, whole K)
 and TF_INKLING_PROMPT_ROWS (default 256)

---
 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2_exl3.cuh      | 142 ++++++++++++++++++++++++
 zig/src/families/inkling2/dump_main.zig |   2 +-
 zig/src/families/inkling2/forward.zig   |  14 ++-
