 rows it sums (tf_ik_pair_sum adds them in rank order) and gathers BF16 sums,
 75% of the bytes; prompt passes of 512 rows and more take three row chunks (a
 sixth, two thirds, a sixth) whose exchanges run on a side stream while the
 main stream computes the next chunk, the experts over every row at once (each
 row's arithmetic unchanged)

---
 zig/kernels/cuda/inkling2_residual.cuh |  10 +
